{"skill":{"slug":"daily-trending","displayName":"daily-trending"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771484894724,"changelog":"- 首次发布 daily-trending 技能，从 tophub.today 抓取各平台热搜榜单\n- 支持知乎、微博、百度、36氪、虎嗅、澎湃、吾爱破解、虎扑等多平台\n- 自动筛选出真正重要、具讨论价值的5条热榜\n- 排除娱乐八卦、广告、主观评论等噪音内容\n- 输出格式统一、只讲事实，便于快速了解每日焦点","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":2582,"sha256":"35b3ffee861b256d12dde918e0e3734cee23432dd9ef1284a60cacc7b8404412","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2125,"sha256":"306ff8307f30e2c9a3644663a2cc088ece5a50c9737bd0fe413d8ec745975079","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789073451555,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"f988c7ce994bd85d7f0b8b56bb4abc5a88b662d5e9a3abc9e509db86482519f7","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/f988c7ce994bd85d7f0b8b56bb4abc5a88b662d5e9a3abc9e509db86482519f7","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: daily-trending\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle is designed to fetch daily trending news from tophub.today and summarize it. The `SKILL.md` file contains instructions for the AI agent to use `web_fetch` to retrieve data from specific paths on `https://tophub.today`. All instructions, including filtering criteria and output formatting, are directly related to the stated purpose of news aggregation and presentation. There is no evidence of data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence mechanisms, or prompt injection attempts to manipulate the agent into unauthorized actions. The use of `web_fetch` to a single, consistent domain for news aggregation is aligned with the skill's description.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779165380077},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":21,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":3,"checkedAt":1789073451555},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a straightforward Chinese daily-trending fetcher that uses public tophub.today pages and does not show hidden, persistent, destructive, or credential-related behavior.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The only operational authority described is fetching public web pages from tophub.today with character limits, proportionate to a trending-news retrieval skill.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact contains only a Markdown SKILL.md file with no bundled executable scripts, dependencies, install hooks, or package mutation behavior.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The trigger includes the short phrase \"热榜\" and the output is constrained to Chinese-style trending-news results, which could be broad or locale-specific but is coherent with the skill's stated purpose.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, memory writes, privilege escalation, credential access, local file indexing, background workers, or tool hijacking instructions are present.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The purpose is to retrieve and summarize current hot-topic lists from tophub.today; the web-fetch behavior and listed endpoints directly match that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this if you want Chinese-language daily hot-topic summaries. Be aware that invoking it may fetch public pages from tophub.today, and its instructions prefer terse Chinese output without source labels, so users should verify important news separately.","findings":"[SQP-1] expected: The trigger term is broad, but it is still a topical Chinese term for trending lists and only routes the agent to public trending-page retrieval; this is a usability note rather than a material security concern.\n[SQP-3] expected: The Chinese-only instructions and output format are consistent with a Chinese trending-news skill, though users wanting multilingual output should be aware of the constraint.\n[SQP-2] expected: The artifact explicitly names tophub.today and lists the exact public URLs to fetch, so network access is disclosed and purpose-aligned.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789073451555}}}}}